OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 12 APR
OL,4,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,5,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,6,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,7,     Gweekend breakfast, plus they
OL,8,     Gcelebrate the 50th anniversary of
OL,9,     Gpioneering punk band the Ramones'
OL,10,     Gdebut album.
OL,11,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,12,     GCerys is joined by Tauseef Akhtar
OL,13,     Gin session and film scholar
OL,14,     GRachel Dwyer, exploring
OL,15,     GBollywood's poetic traditions
OL,16,     Gwith live ghazals, rich cinema
OL,17,     Ginsight and archive moments.
OL,18,G1300FMarc Riley's Finest Hour
OL,19,     GMarc Riley is in for Guy,
OL,20,     Gbringing you his Finest Flour .
OL,21,     GHe's even got a game you can play
OL,22,     Gat home.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
